<title>JAPAN: Sakura Bank sees 1996/97 parent operating Y250 bln.</title>
<headline>Sakura Bank sees 1996/97 parent operating Y250 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sakura Bank Ltd said on Friday that it expects a parent operating profit of 250 billion yen for the full business year ending on March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The bank posted a parent operating profit of 333.2 billion in the previous year.</p>
</text>
